      "description": "Department of Tourism (DOT) Secretary Christina Garcia Frasco and Brunei Darussalam Minister of Primary Resources and Tourism Dato Seri Setia Dr Haji Abdul Manaf bin Haji Metussin formally signed the Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) on Tourism Cooperation which aims to strengthen, promote and develop cooperation in the field of tourism by increasing tourist arrivals, encouraging visits and healthy growth of the tourism industry in both countries, as witnessed by President Ferdinand R. Marcos, Jr. and His Majesty Sultan Haji Hassanal Bolkiah Mu’izzaddin Waddaulah Ibni Al-Marhum Sultan Haji Omar ‘Ali Saifuddien Sa’adul Khairi Waddien, during the state visit on Tuesday (May 28) at Istana Nurul Iman, Brunei Darussalam.",
